ong>title</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>message</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>button_text</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>recommended</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>can_report</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>entities</strong> (List of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/message-entity/#pyrogram.raw.base.MessageEntity\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.MessageEntity\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MessageEntity</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>photo</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/photo/#pyrogram.raw.base.Photo\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.Photo\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Photo</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>media</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/message-media/#pyrogram.raw.base.MessageMedia\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.MessageMedia\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MessageMedia</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>color</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/peer-color/#pyrogram.raw.base.PeerColor\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.PeerColor\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PeerColor</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><st